#KK34NPIN2DER4BDIVKYXXRZ2AVJJ6BRLEM43UIEZIHZQCG2542425UGYN72HMGIPHFV5ZBIJJGQLU
#\\\|G4YZD2N4DRXBVE24VPZF7EU3SAO7W32L3GWPNXECPFYME755H5L \ / AMOS7 \ YOURUM ::
#\[7]QLIRNVJWPQ7FXP6WK75AFBSC7V5RVSTOKZNB37LYZX6H5BYMRKDY 7  DATA SIGNATURE ::
#:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
